{"candidateAnswer":"She is in a committed relationship","evidence":"[D2:5 | 9:49 am on 27 January, 2023] Deborah: My husband and I are trying to be as good a family as my parents were!\n[D19:11 | 12:52 am on 19 August, 2023] Deborah: Reminds me of when I used to play games with my husband. We'd take turns and it was a great way to bond and make memories. Gaming really can bring people closer, right?\n[D23:4 | 11:46 am on 30 August, 2023] Deborah: Yep, last month I visited my mom`s house which holds a special place in my heart. My mom had good and bad times there, but it's still a symbol of her strength and the love she shared with me. This is my husband in front of this house.\n[D28:11 | 3:09 pm on 15 September, 2023] Deborah: That beach is super special to me. It's where I got married and discovered my love for surfing. It's always filled with joy and peace.","itemId":"urn:uuid:9a8c8a48-abc7-50fb-80d5-9c7b46301c56","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:ebb545b77a9d81b788a94af98acbe1dc1ab6b46c7a8dbaf4d7d00a354c751349","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Is Deborah married?","referenceAnswer":"yes","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb545b77a9d81b788a94af98acbe1dc1ab6b46c7a8dbaf4d7d00a354c751349"}}]}